Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Optionally trace batched DeepGEMM MoE metadata

Writes one JSON line per BatchedDeepGemmExperts call (expert token counts,
M sizes, top-k) to $VLLM_DEEPGEMM_MOE_TRACE_PATH or $DEEPGEMM_MOE_TRACE_PATH;
does nothing when neither is set.

Upstream: vLLM, https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm (Apache License 2.0),
base commit d4004455d2357985830af10e432709b42c820455; the modified file keeps
its SPDX license header. Apply both with `git apply` on that commit.

Provenance: 0001 and 0002, each read from its `diff --git` line on, are the two
file diffs of the uncommitted change in the vLLM checkout the FastAFD alignment
reference was built from; concatenated they are that change as one diff,
sha256 899ee3acce35eee4da5c3ae57e5479782e3faa1173981786f1eafe27e5e303e3.
---
diff --git a/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/experts/batched_deep_gemm_moe.py b/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/experts/batched_deep_gemm_moe.py
index 7bd383b9c..442ecefd9 100644
--- a/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/experts/batched_deep_gemm_moe.py
+++ b/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/experts/batched_deep_gemm_moe.py
@@ -1,6 +1,9 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
